'QuasiFeffermanB.Q09_POST_CUTOFF_SMOOTHNESS' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice.{u}, Quot.sound.{u}]
AXIOMS_END:QuasiFeffermanB.Q09_POST_CUTOFF_SMOOTHNESS
